    {
      "id": 92371,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "The Steamworks Product Data web site had an URL route with insufficient access controls, which would allow an authenticated partner to view data for games which they might not otherwise have permissions to view. After mitigation, an audit of accesses to this URL route showed no accesses by parties other than Valve or the reporter of this issue.",
